  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.05 Failure to Appear or Respond",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.05 Failure to Appear or Respond. If a party to a commission proceeding fails to appear at a hearing or respond when required to a commission order, the commission shall conduct the scheduled hearing or decide the contested issue without that party’s input.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
